creator perspective.

It is intended to be used to give guidance on the elements that may be
contained within it.

Aligning with the guidance produced in
Types of Software Bill of Material (SBOM) Documents &lt;https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/2023-04/sbom-types-document-508c.pdf&gt;.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
