text applied to it.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:note</td><td align='left'>&quot;A WithAdditionOperator indicates that the designated License is subject to the
designated LicenseAddition, which can be a license exception on the
SPDX License Exceptions &lt;https://spdx.org/licenses/exceptions-index.html&gt;
