# https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/UseAction node308
node308 [ shape=none, color=black label=< <table color='#666666' cellborder='0' cellspacing='0' border='1'><tr><td colspan='2' bgcolor='grey'><B>UseAction</B></td></tr><tr><td href='https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/UseAction' bgcolor='#eeeeee' colspan='2'><font point-size='10' color='#6666ff'>https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/UseAction</font></td></tr><tr><td align='left'>rdfs:comment</td><td align='left'>&quot;The action of product use.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:definition</td><td align='left'>&quot;The action of product use.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:note</td><td align='left'>&quot;This is the specific action of product use.

Relationship:

For each UseAction there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of &#x27;performedBy’ on the from and a /Core/Agent class or subclass on the to.

For each UseAction there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of &#x27;affects’ on the from and a /Core/Element class or subclass on the to.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
