# https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Extension/CdxPropertyEntry node1667
node1667 [ shape=none, color=black label=< <table color='#666666' cellborder='0' cellspacing='0' border='1'><tr><td colspan='2' bgcolor='grey'><B>CdxPropertyEntry</B></td></tr><tr><td href='https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Extension/CdxPropertyEntry' bgcolor='#eeeeee' colspan='2'><font point-size='10' color='#6666ff'>https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Extension/CdxPropertyEntry</font></td></tr><tr><td align='left'>rdfs:comment</td><td align='left'>&quot;A property name with an associated value.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:definition</td><td align='left'>&quot;A property name with an associated value.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:note</td><td align='left'>&quot;Each CdxPropertyEntry contains a name-value pair which maps the name to its
associated value.

Unlike key-value stores, properties in CdxPropertiesExtension support duplicate
names, each potentially having different values.

This class can be used to implement CycloneDX compatible properties.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
